不生成BGM：不要音乐、配乐、旋律，只保留{{环境声}}、金属声、打斗音效、发力声和{{@BGM对白}}环境声。
Practical in-camera effects only: {{实拍特效}}. [[{{唯一的东西}} ]]No glowing energy, no light beams, no particle-system effects, no radial zoom blur, no drawn speed lines, no video-game effects.
